; cobalt_vcs_git is the git backend of cobalt_vcs: pure parsers of git's porcelain output,
; the git CLI rules every command follows, and git actions as command plans. No
; Async, no Unix, no process: specs go out and reports come back through cobalt_vcs
; types. The .mli files document the backend contracts.

(library
 (name cobalt_vcs_git)
 (libraries cobalt_vcs core)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_jane)))
